              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 14:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika onyuthan bende jwom ma pi ma kelo kwo, maler pa ndewiro, ma mol kareno wok i kom ma dhum pa Were kodi apa Nyathi rombo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 2:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka mol i dier royo ma tindi. I thengi jwom korin gi korin oyido nitie yath ma kwo, ma nyak gim'opokere apar g'ario i oro, dicel kisi dwe, aka boke mere obedo ma botho nonin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 14:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 3:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongoye gima Were okwoŋo ma bino nwaŋere i tindi no. Kom ma dhum pa Were kodi apa Nyathi rombo ama bino bed'iye, aka jotic pere jobino lamo go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobino neno waŋe, aka ibino ndiko nyinge i nyim jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.60.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 60:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Colo ma wor odoko kilabedo, aka jokibino yenyo lero ma tala kosa lero ma waŋceŋ, Rwoth Were won ama bino bedo lero pajo, aka jobino dhumo cil gi cil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dwoko pa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo malaika owaco ran ni, “Wac me obedo mar'adieri aka genere. Aka Rwoth Were ma miyo jotuci wac Were Cuny Maleŋ pere, ooro malaika pere nyutho jotic pere gima kidho timere mayot.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu owaco ni, “Winji, abino mayot! Jasilwany a ŋata mako wac pa jotuci wac Were ma kitawo me!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An Yohana, aŋat'awinjo kendo aneno gigipiny me je. Aka munyo atieko winjo gi neno gime, agore piny dho tiendi malaika m'onyuthan gigipiny me ni alam go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To go owaco ran ni, “Ikir'itim ameno! Abedo jatic nyawotin, i dier wutmere kodi jotuci wac Were kodi ji je ma jomako wac ma kitawo me. Lami Were ayino!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo owaco ran ni, “Ikir'ipan wac m'otuci i kitawo me rupiri ndir orikere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.12.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 12:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi jatim reco womedere gi timo reco, aka ŋata koc womedere gi koco pere, ŋataber womedere gi timo bero, ŋataleŋ womedere gi leŋo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
