        },
        {
          "text": "An Yohana, anyutho dhano je ma winjo wac m'otuci i kitawo me kicutho ni, ka moro omed'iye wac man, Were bino medo i gir'acula pere thoyamo ma sika ji m'oluw kwoŋe i kitawo me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
