              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ka moro okwany woko wac moro je m'otuci i kitawo me, Were bino kwanyo woko adec pere ma gima nyak kwoŋ yath ma kelo kwo, kodi ma tindi maleŋ, m'otuci i kitawo me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
